  "definition": "Behind-the-Wheel Instruction Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-04-05",
  "historyNote": "#9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3113.12); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3114.14) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
